      en: ["Kenema is the third-largest city in Sierra Leone and a major hub for cocoa trading.", "Cocoa seedlings typically spend about 4 to 6 months in the nursery before being transplanted.", "Sierra Leone exports over 15,000 tons of cocoa beans annually.", "The peak harvesting season for cocoa runs from September through March.", "Cocoa trees begin to bear fruit approximately 3 to 5 years after being planted.", "Shade trees used in nurseries can reduce soil temperature by up to 5 degrees Celsius."],
