      en: ["The park was opened in 1887 to celebrate the Golden Jubilee of Queen Victoria's reign.", "It is located adjacent to the National Museum of Sierra Leone in central Freetown.", "The central bandstand in the park dates back to the early 1900s.", "During the 1990s, the park occasionally served as a sanctuary for displaced persons.", "The park's official name has been maintained as 'Victoria Park' since independence.", "The grounds are open to the public daily from dawn until dusk for recreation."],
